+    Three states, never a bool: ``watchdog`` and ``none`` have different remedies (the first needs
+    none; the second needs a container limit), and "no cap asked" and "cap asked, unenforceable" are
+    kept apart by the caller's own rollup, which reads ``cap_requested`` first.
